asset:        Inter-Regular.ttf
title:        Inter Regular (UI typeface)
author:       The Inter Project Authors (Rasmus Andersson et al.)
source:       https://github.com/rsms/inter
license:      OFL-1.1
license-file: assets/fonts/OFL-Inter.txt
added:        2026-09-30 by Claude (agent) for Brandon Thomas
notes:        Unmodified font file, embedded via include_bytes! in the text engine (crates/text/src/fonts.rs), which also supplies it to the UI (crates/ui-egui/src/theme.rs). DCP exports embed it, unmodified, as the default subtitle font of the timed text track file (crates/export/src/dcp_out.rs, #938; OFL 1.1 permits embedding in documents).
